<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    RML Logical Source requires one rml:source and requires everyting\n    an Abstract Logical Source requires.\n    " .
_:nbcd063c9eaf34d8290bbab7d64b8baf0b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/predicate> .
_:na07dd9dd17f4400d817e3ec02764f4d2b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:na07dd9dd17f4400d817e3ec02764f4d2b7 .
_:n3e9d92108dc341adb5fddfca78e0603ab2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n3e9d92108dc341adb5fddfca78e0603ab3 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLInputShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n4bc3b7cc62e94ab0a4e5dbaec86fc5c2b11 .
_:ncbc17327df0648bdb909d901fb88e841b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\n        Inclusion (and ForeignKey) annotations targeting this logical view\n        via rml:targetView. Reached via the inverse of rml:targetView, not\n        rml:structuralAnnotation -- an InclusionAnnotation is the SUBJECT\n        of rml:targetView, not this view's own value, so it isn't\n        otherwise reachable from here; without this property it would\n        never get checked at all.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLExpressionMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ExpressionMap" .
_:ncbc17327df0648bdb909d901fb88e841b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:n56c60bcd9b1f47218925e2df4dbf8b61b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:input must be an IRI or Blank node.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalTargetShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RML Logical Target" .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:nbcd063c9eaf34d8290bbab7d64b8baf0b1 .
_:n5e8ec82e5cc14e60a1f49524903a4f49b10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/child> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RML Logical Source" .
_:n42f980332e8241eb91d69b1f7fcabde8b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:nd0afa5c5334a43a3991a6fb13ad52186b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:template must be a string with well-formed brace delimiters:\n        every unescaped '{' must be closed by an unescaped '}' with no\n        unescaped braces in between, and every literal '{', '}', or '\\'\n        (both inside and outside reference expressions) must be\n        backslash-escaped.\n        " .
_:n4bc3b7cc62e94ab0a4e5dbaec86fc5c2b8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:n4bc3b7cc62e94ab0a4e5dbaec86fc5c2b9 .
_:n42f980332e8241eb91d69b1f7fcabde8b8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:n42f980332e8241eb91d69b1f7fcabde8b9 .
_:n7688b4121e304c73ba0de5ed879c3787b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:nbcd063c9eaf34d8290bbab7d64b8baf0b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Either an rml:object or rml:objectMap must be provided, not multiple\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLExpressionMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n3979b8ab1de34c7bb03d841af527670fb1 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalTargetShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    A logical target is any target to where generated RDF triples are exported\n    to.\n    " .
_:n42f980332e8241eb91d69b1f7fcabde8b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n42f980332e8241eb91d69b1f7fcabde8b6 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/IterableFieldShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
_:nde64aaff81da487eaf1926276d2fd481b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:nd8acc496ad624c3db72cf9ef0b35ed4fb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/termType> .
_:n5f31892e11d245978ad6d4e23ec50388b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#zeroOrMorePath> <http://w3id.org/rml/condition> .
_:ncbc17327df0648bdb909d901fb88e841b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/InclusionAnnotationShape> .
_:nd0afa5c5334a43a3991a6fb13ad52186b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
_:nf414508586fd4c088f7551162368c0d3b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The target (rml:target) locates the output target. It is a URI\n        that represents the target where it must export generated RDF triples\n        to.\n        " .
_:n495649027bfc414d93b9b14abce94953b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/compression> .
_:n5e8ec82e5cc14e60a1f49524903a4f49b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/parentMap> .
_:n5e8ec82e5cc14e60a1f49524903a4f49b12 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specifies the child of the object component for joining.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/FieldShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n    Node must have a valid rml:Field description.\r\n    rml:Field requires a rml:fieldName and may have zero or more rml:field properties.\r\n    Furthermore, subclass rml:ExpressionField requires what an rml:ExpressionMap requires, subclass rml:IterableField requires what an rml:Iterable requires,.\r\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLNamespaceShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    A Namespace requires exactly one rml:namespacePrefix and exactly one\n    rml:namespaceURL.\n    " .
_:n42f980332e8241eb91d69b1f7fcabde8b30 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:n0493cb288a5649658b27565940d9d34ab1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\r\n        property onFields specifies the fields in LogicalView that are involved by the structural annotation. The semantics of this involvement depends on the specific annotation.\r\n        " .
_:n4bc3b7cc62e94ab0a4e5dbaec86fc5c2b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Exactly one rml:parameter or rml:parameterMap is required.\n        " .
_:ncbc17327df0648bdb909d901fb88e841b13 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:ncbc17327df0648bdb909d901fb88e841b14 .
_:n0493cb288a5649658b27565940d9d34ab1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:nf414508586fd4c088f7551162368c0d3b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLFormatShape> .
_:nbcd063c9eaf34d8290bbab7d64b8baf0b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        At least one rml:predicate or rml:predicateMap must be provided.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLParentMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:ParentMap must specify a literal referencing data in the parent data\n    source.\n    " .
_:n4e7ff4e2a2f0420aa1b99dc516a0ced4b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/path> .
_:nd5ad5542aa6b44639308bb9ef574b597b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:ncbc17327df0648bdb909d901fb88e841b22 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#inversePath> _:ncbc17327df0648bdb909d901fb88e841b23 .
_:N11a86f53a3384c6ba5ecc496ec70b31e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:ncbc17327df0648bdb909d901fb88e841b27 .
_:nbcd063c9eaf34d8290bbab7d64b8baf0b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:n81bf962b24164e4995191c5c007df66fb2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        At least one rml:parentLogicalView property must be specified for a rml:LogicalViewJoin, with a resource as its value.\r\n        " .
_:nbcd063c9eaf34d8290bbab7d64b8baf0b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:predicateMap must be an IRI or blank node and be provided once.\n        " .
_:ncbc17327df0648bdb909d901fb88e841b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Every rml:InclusionAnnotation (or rml:ForeignKeyAnnotation) targeting this view via rml:targetView must also specify exactly one rml:targetFields property.\n        " .
