_:nbcd063c9eaf34d8290bbab7d64b8baf0b11 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        An ObjectMap element to generate the object component of the \n        (predicate, object) pair from a logical table row or iterator.\n        " .
